<title>USA: Oncogene Science names Goddard president.</title>
<headline>Oncogene Science names Goddard president.</headline>
<dateline>UNIONDALE, N.Y. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oncogene Science Inc said Thursday Colin Goddard was elected president of the company.</p>
<p>Goddard was executive vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Goddard replaces Steve Teltzman, who left the company several months ago to head NuGene Technology, a private company in Boston.</p>
<p>Oncogene said it had no plans to fill Goddard's former posts at the company.</p>
</text>
